{"name":"Automated Database Backup & Verification","nodes":[{"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"hours","hoursInterval":24}]}},"id":"schedule","name":"Schedule - Daily Backup","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","typeVersion":1,"position":[250,300]},{"parameters":{"command":"pg_dump {{ $env.DATABASE_NAME }} | gzip > /backups/backup_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).sql.gz"},"id":"create-backup","name":"pg_dump - Create Backup","type":"n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand","typeVersion":1,"position":[450,300]},{"parameters":{"command":"aws s3 cp /backups/backup_*.sql.gz s3://{{ $env.S3_BACKUP_BUCKET }}/"},"id":"upload-s3","name":"AWS S3 - Upload Backup","type":"n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand","typeVersion":1,"position":[650,300]},{"parameters":{"operation":"executeQuery","query":"INSERT INTO backup_logs (backup_file, size_bytes, s3_location, status) VALUES ('{{ $('pg_dump - Create Backup').item.json }}', {{ $('pg_dump - Create Backup').item.json.length }}, 's3://{{ $env.S3_BACKUP_BUCKET }}/{{ $('pg_dump - Create Backup').item.json }}', 'completed') RETURNING *;"},"id":"log-backup","name":"PostgreSQL - Log Backup","type":"n8n-nodes-base.postgres","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[850,300],"credentials":{"postgres":{"id":"4","name":"PostgreSQL"}}}],"connections":{"Schedule - Daily Backup":{"main":[[{"node":"pg_dump - Create Backup","type":"main","index":0}]]},"pg_dump - Create Backup":{"main":[[{"node":"AWS S3 - Upload Backup","type":"main","index":0}]]},"AWS S3 - Upload Backup":{"main":[[{"node":"PostgreSQL - Log Backup","type":"main","index":0}]]}},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"tags":[{"id":"devops","name":"DevOps & CI/CD"}],"versionId":"1.0.0"}
